## Social Events

It would not be a Community Over Code without our fantastic get-togethers. Here is the schedule to plan your evenings accordingly:

* Sunday, Oct. 11, 7-9 pm, [[]Glasgow Science Centre](https://www.glasgowsciencecentre.org/), all-attendee reception
* Monday, Oct. 12, 7-9 pm, Grand Ballroom, Games Night (organized by the Infra team)
* Tuesday, Oct. 13, 7-9 pm, Grand Ballroom, Trivia Night
* Wednesday, Oct. 14, 6-8 pm, Grand Ballroom, Lightning Talks!
